      "content": "breathing doesn't do anything. i've tried all that. the thoughts just come right back. it feels like i'm fighting a losing battle every single day just to exist. when i say \"absolute silence,\" i don't mean just a moment of calm. i mean real, permanent silence. like, nothingness. is that even possible? or is the noise just something you're stuck with forever?",
